<BaseLayout title="Privacy"><div class="wrap static-page"><span class="eyebrow">Respect for readers</span><h1>Privacy, by design.</h1><div class="prose"><p>This initial version is a static educational website. It has no visitor accounts, newsletter subscriptions, contact form, cookies intentionally set by our application, or site-integrated analytics.</p><p>Our hosting provider may process ordinary request information, such as IP addresses, for security and delivery. We have not added third-party advertising trackers or visitor profiling services.</p><p>Readers may optionally choose the Google Translate language selector to open a Google-hosted translation of the current page. When selected, the browser sends the current page URL to Google Translate, which may retrieve and process the public page content to provide a translation. This takes the reader to Google's service and is subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's Privacy Policy</a>. Machine translations may be inaccurate. The site does not load Google's retired embedded Website Translator script or send page content to a project-owned translation API.</p><p>If future versions add forms, analytics or accounts, we will revise this notice before enabling those features. This page should be reviewed against the actual deployed hosting configuration before public launch.</p></div></div></BaseLayout>
